 "texto": "Iman Gadzhi\n1,320 posts\nIman Gadzhi\n@GadzhiIman\nOwner: consulting.com (Est. 2016)\nCo-Owner: @whop ($5b + GMV)\nInvestor & Advisor: @higgsfield\nTe uniste el marzo de 2019\n177 Siguiendo\n815,7 mil Seguidores\nMencionar\nSeguir\nPosts\nRespuestas\nReposts\nMultimedia\nArtículos\nFijado\nIman Gadzhi\n@GadzhiIman\n12 oct\nI’ve been keeping this a secret for a while, but earlier this year I made one of the biggest bets of my career & this time it's not in Silicon Valley or New York. It's in Almaty, Kazakhstan.\n\nI'm proud to officially announce that I'm an investor & advisor to @higgsfield\n00:22\n272\n151\n5 mil\n759 mil\nIman Gadzhi\n@GadzhiIman\n21 oct\nGenerational company. Generational team.\n\nI invest to be on the right side of history. Whop has been a home run, but what we're building matters more: a brighter future for builders and dreamers.\n\nProud of the team. We're just getting started.\nSteven Schwartz 🦅\n@cultured\n21 oct\nWhop has raised $200M in Series D funding at a $5.1B valuation, backed by @sequoia and @Shopify.\n\nIt really feels like we are barely touching the tip of the iceberg in a market larger than anyone can imagine.\n\nWe first launched Whop as a better way for us to sell sneaker bots, Mostrar más\n00:44\n23\n21\n784\n48 mil\nIman Gadzhi\n@GadzhiIman\n15 oct\nE-commerce businesses deserve white glove service, we make it our mission to provide that.\n\nEarly days - but feedback has been great. We’d love to have you.\nHunter\n@GronkWiz\n15 oct\nUpdate on Whop Ecommerce\n\nSince launching Whop for Ecommerce on October 1st, 100s of businesses from Squarespace, CheckoutChamp, BigCommerce, and more have reached out wanting to migrate to Whop.\n\n> We now have multiple brands doing $300k+/day and 100s of live, happy stores Mostrar más\n22\n7\n372\n35 mil\nIman Gadzhi\n@GadzhiIman\n14 oct\nOutside of the eye-watering compensation structure. Whop is such a fast moving, exciting culture to be apart of. If you’re a killer - I would consider applying. Yes, you make a lot of money but more importantly I think it’s fun working alongside people that are savages.\nari\n@hmaceater\n12 oct\nWhop has scaled from 0->multi billions/year in education/info volume in 3 years\n\ni am looking for 3 people to join our GTM team - top performers make $1m/year + equity + benefits\n\ntext me @ 917-697-7442\n\npics from FHL takeover attached\n7\n5\n413\n32 mil\nIman Gadzhi\n@GadzhiIman\n3 oct\nNo more taking the high ground. Will post receipts from now on.\nIman Gadzhi\n@GadzhiIman\n3 oct\nEn respuesta a @imaarontang\nIsn’t this you?\n56\n10\n1 mil\n265 mil\nObtén la experiencia de la app completa\nDesbloquea más funciones y descubre de qué se habla ahora mismo.\nAbrir X\nIniciar sesión o registrarse en X\n\nMira lo que está pasando y únete a la conversación\n\nContinue with phone\nContinuar con Apple\nContinuar con Google\nContinuar con Google\no\nIniciar sesión con nombre de usuario o correo electrónico\nTérminos\n·\nPrivacidad\n·\nCookies\n·\nAccesibilidad\n·\nInformación sobre anuncios\n·\nMás opciones\n© 2026 X Corp."
